      {
        "particleId": "contentarray-2308",
        "particleTitle": "Welcome from the Principal",
        "particleType": "contentarray",
        "filterPath": "expanded > grid-7261 > block-8784 > contentarray-2308.attributes.article.filter",
        "categories": [],
        "articles": [
          {
            "id": "143873",
            "title": "Welcome from the Principal",
            "alias": "welcome-from-the-principal",
            "categoryId": "147",
            "categoryTitle": "- - Homepage Articles (School)",
            "introtext": "\t<div class=\"wel-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wel-title\">\n<h3 class=\"g-title\">Welcome from the Principal</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wel-content\">\n<p>Welcome to St. Joseph Catholic School!</p>\n<p>At St. Joseph, we are dedicated to providing an environment where academic excellence and faith formation go hand in hand. As a community, we strive to nurture the unique gifts of every student, helping them grow intellectually, spiritually, and socially.</p>\n<p>Our committed faculty and staff work tirelessly to create a safe, supportive, and challenging atmosphere where students are encouraged to seek the truth, serve others, and lead with character. Whether in the classroom, at prayer, or on the playing field, our students are taught to see the presence of God in all things.</p>\n<p>I invite you to explore our website and learn more about the vibrant life of our school. We are proud of our rich traditions and excited about the future of our students. Thank you for your interest in St. Joseph Catholic School—we look forward to partnering with you in the education and faith journey of your child.</p>\n<p>Blessings,</p>\n<p>Mr. Hoffman<br />Principal</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wel-button\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#\">Read Full Letter</a></div>\n</div>",
            "fulltext": "",
            "state": "1",
            "access": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
